<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2933; line-height: 1.5">
  <h2 style="margin: 0 0 12px; color: #b42318; font-size: 20px">
    Errore controllo Anticipay
  </h2>

  <p style="margin: 0 0 16px">
    Il controllo Anticipay ha restituito un errore e richiede una verifica
    amministrativa.
  </p>

  <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">
    Link Account Salesforce:
    <a href="{{accountLink}}" style="color: #1b5f8c">{{accountLink}}</a>
  </p>

  <table
    cellpadding="0"
    cellspacing="0"
    style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 680px"
  >
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec; font-weight: bold">
        Account
      </td>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec">{{accountId}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec; font-weight: bold">
        Stato HTTP
      </td>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec">{{httpStatus}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec; font-weight: bold">
        Messaggio
      </td>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec">{{message}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec; font-weight: bold">
        Log integrazione
      </td>
      <td style="padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d9e2ec">{{logId}}</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin: 18px 0 0; color: #52606d; font-size: 13px">
    Email generata automaticamente da Salesforce.
  </p>
</div>
